Android StartLevel (000817ac) divides percentages by 100. At 40% Challenge
difficulty, multiplying by the PC reciprocal rounds the target down one row
and can skip a complete finish segment. Android RMathInit (00029698), Sin
(000268a8) and Cos (0002685c) use 32,768 entries. Their finer spacing changes
both the shape of a path and whether the snail remains attached at its edge.

